                        "sense_id": "99914734-7bae-39c0-b384-049de7d59928",
                        "entry_id": "cf097faf-1ac8-3b8d-b264-b9d3584e4364",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Debased; degraded; lowly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "61301b35-e4b7-4235-a8e1-12e6f79ebbb7",
                                "sense_id": "99914734-7bae-39c0-b384-049de7d59928",
                                "text": "One last consolation, however, was left to the casual poor and naturally enough they tended to clutch at it: their women could be more demeaned, more lowly, than they."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c6a2b8f-369f-4d75-8e07-bedfa5e9c075",
                                "sense_id": "99914734-7bae-39c0-b384-049de7d59928",
                                "text": "Antiope is the more demeaned that she was violated by so outrageous a figure of ribaldry and degradation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d052511e-355b-4384-8132-c11788f7ce74",
                                "sense_id": "99914734-7bae-39c0-b384-049de7d59928",
                                "text": "Wearing make-up made her feel \"very degraded and very demeaned.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0e5b38be-cfb5-3b4e-b06b-742163b8ddee",
                        "entry_id": "cf097faf-1ac8-3b8d-b264-b9d3584e4364",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having had the mean subtracted from all values."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
