                                "sense_id": "0e5b38be-cfb5-3b4e-b06b-742163b8ddee",
                                "text": "The 0-crossings in a demeaned signal can indicate the dominant frequency component in a signal."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "059a23c9-ec71-4e40-952b-bc5a74248d15",
                                "sense_id": "0e5b38be-cfb5-3b4e-b06b-742163b8ddee",
                                "text": "A demeaned version of this time series x is depicted in ( B ) ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cff2d0cc-2236-4b4f-bcd0-a2a483864b7e",
                                "sense_id": "0e5b38be-cfb5-3b4e-b06b-742163b8ddee",
                                "text": "To pursue the analogy between a driftless random walk and a Wiener process a bit further, consider a “demeaned standard random walk\" which is constructed from a standard driftless random walk by subtracting the sample mean."
                            }
                        ]
